      "html": "<p>Items change with the system. The shape does not.</p><p><strong>System:</strong> make, model and serial of heat pump, cylinder, buffer tank, pump and expansion vessel. Address, date, your name and certificate number.</p><p><strong>Water side:</strong> design and actual flow rate, static pressure, expansion vessel pre-charge, relief valve set point, fill pressure. Proof of flushing and inhibitor dose, with product, strength and pH.</p><p><strong>Heat pump:</strong> flow and return temperatures at design conditions. Delta T. Refrigerant pressures where you can reach them. Defrost and fan checked.</p><p><strong>Emitters and controls:</strong> output and flow for each radiator, lockshield settings, underfloor manifold flow, weather compensation curve, flow set point, hot water and anti-Legionella cycle, and controls handed over.</p>"
